    "synopsis": "Girls und Panzer drawn by the master of war gekiga! The path of the tank drawn by the master of war gekiga is here! Kobayashi Motofumi sensei appears to instruct Nishizumi Miho and the other members of Oarai Girls' Academy. Characters from \"Cat Shit One,\" \"Kurokishi Monogatari,\" \"OMEGA7,\" \"Ookami no Housei,\" and more join the fray, as the story plunges into the biggest operation in Oarai's history, one that will decide its very survival! The original manuscript drawn for the game \"World of Tanks\" is also included! Kobayashi sensei's comical side is sure to make you laugh! Note: Chapter count includes a six chapter manga about Motofumi Kobayashi's experience with the video game World of Tanks (Source: CoroCoro)",
